# finish/mote: the living finish's mote (STYLE_P2 27.7; P2C_CONTRACTS 6b `fx mote`; LADDER-FINISH, ladder slice i3): a
# rising spark drawn by the view as a particle: a1 (its first third) a 1x2 streak, white head over a Glow 2 tail so it
# reads as moving up; a2 (the middle third) one Glow 3 pixel; a3 (the last third) one Glow 2 pixel, its light fading.
use person
body adult
role fx mote
legend 2 glow 2
legend 3 glow 3
legend 4 glow 4
layer fx
anchor pivot
keys fx
tags overlay

view D key a1 origin 0 0
|4
|2

view D key a2 origin 0 0
|3

view D key a3 origin 0 0
|2

view U key a1 origin 0 0
|4
|2

view U key a2 origin 0 0
|3

view U key a3 origin 0 0
|2

view R key a1 origin 0 0
|4
|2

view R key a2 origin 0 0
|3

view R key a3 origin 0 0
|2

view L key a1 origin 0 0
|4
|2

view L key a2 origin 0 0
|3

view L key a3 origin 0 0
|2
